THIRD-PARTY AND DERIVED ASSET TERMS

The MIT terms above cover the software in this repository (`src/`, `scripts/`)
and its documentation. Bundled scenario/config assets under `data/` are derived
in part from third-party datasets that carry their own terms:

- MathDial (Macina et al., 2023) — CC BY-SA 4.0
- Bridge (Wang et al., 2024) — CC BY 4.0
- BEA 2025 Shared Task data (Kochmar et al., 2025) — see the original release
- Math Misconceptions Benchmark (Otero et al., 2025) — see the original release

Portions of `data/exp3v2_scenario_bank.json` are adapted from these sources or
generated as problem-context variants. Users redistributing or modifying the
bundled assets must comply with the terms of the corresponding upstream
releases, including the ShareAlike condition of CC BY-SA 4.0 where it applies.
Dataset payloads themselves are not redistributed here; see `datasets/README.md`
for download instructions.
